# A nomadic people with origins in India, the [[Romani]].
# A subgroup of the [[Romani]] people found primarily in Eastern Europe.
# A [[variety]] of the [[Romani]] language {{lb|en|or occasionally}} the [[Romani]] [[macrolanguage]].

